@using CultSimulator.Game
@inject GameService Game

<div class="story-screen fixed inset-0 z-[90] flex items-center justify-center p-6 animate-fade-in"
     style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(30,58,95,0.92) 0%, rgba(5,15,31,0.96) 70%); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);">
    <div class="story-card relative max-w-lg w-full text-center overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-10 animate-modal-rise"
         style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,58,95,0.6), rgba(12,30,61,0.8)); border: 1px solid rgba(96,165,250,0.25);">
        <div class="story-glow absolute -top-1/3 -left-1/3 w-[160%] h-[160%] pointer-events-none animate-slow-rotate-20"
             style="background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(96,165,250,0.10) 0%, transparent 60%);"></div>
        <div class="story-content relative">
            <div class="story-emblem text-5xl mb-4">⚔️</div>
            <h1 class="story-title font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-amber-100 tracking-[0.12em] mb-4">The Path of Conquest</h1>
            <div class="story-body text-sm leading-7 text-blue-200 space-y-3 mb-6">
                <p>From the salt-wind harbor of <span class="text-amber-200">Skanör</span>, your Viking order takes its first breath. The old gods still whisper in the frost. Behind you: nothing but the dark and the cold Baltic.</p>
                <p>Seven continents stand before you — <span class="text-amber-200">Europe</span> first, where rival Viking covens guard the old runestones. Then onward: the modern occultists of <span class="text-amber-200">North America</span>, the jungle shamans of <span class="text-amber-200">South America</span>, the ancient sorcerers of <span class="text-amber-200">Africa</span>, the djinn-binders of the <span class="text-amber-200">Middle East</span>, the ninja and samurai of <span class="text-amber-200">Asia</span>, and finally the dream-walkers of <span class="text-amber-200">Oceania</span>.</p>
                <p>Each continent holds <span class="text-amber-200">five covens</span>. Take them all, one by one, growing harder with each conquest. Only when a continent falls can you begin the <span class="text-amber-200">Shadow War</span> — infiltrating its institutions. Then march onward to the next land.</p>
                <p>Thirty-four covens stand between you and dominion over the hidden world. <span class="text-amber-100 font-display tracking-wide">Become the biggest coven in the world.</span></p>
            </div>
            <button class="story-confirm w-full py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-blue-700 border-none rounded-xl text-white font-display font-semibold text-sm tracking-[0.2em] cursor-pointer transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(96,165,250,0.25)]"
                    @onclick="Dismiss">
                Begin the Conquest
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter] public EventCallback OnDismissed { get; set; }

    private void Dismiss()
    {
        Game.MarkStoryShown();
        OnDismissed.InvokeAsync();
    }
}